WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.920 align:start position:19%
Coincidence?
The radiation fuels this theory. Fallout

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:13.080 align:start position:19%
from a failed test, a weapon no one will
admit existed. And the orange skin? Some

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:18.000 align:start position:19%
say chemical burns. Some say the flash
of something exploding in the sky.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:24.200 align:start position:19%
Theory five, the Mansi spoke of the
Menk, a giant wild creature of the deep

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:30.320 align:start position:19%
forest. A yeti-like beast could slash a
tent, crush a skull, and vanish without

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:37.240 align:start position:19%
a trace. Yet no tracks were ever found.
Dubinina lay face down in a stream for

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:42.640 align:start position:19%
two months. Nature, not monsters, may
explain the cruelest details. In 2019,

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:47.120 align:start position:19%
Russia reopened the case. Their
conclusion, an avalanche. Case closed.

